config BR2_PACKAGE_MCUD
	bool "mcud"
	help
	  The SRNUBI T313D's power MCU on ttyS1: holds the screen's power (the MCU cuts it otherwise), sends the release
	  for a power cycle, and relays the MCU's classic Bluetooth (AT# lines and its RFCOMM data channels) over
	  /run/mcud.sock. S03mcu starts it.
